{
  "info": {
    "name": "FIAP Fase 4 - Feedback API",
    "description": "Collection for testing the Feedback API with REST endpoints for creating and managing feedback.\n\nTwo environments:\n- local: LocalStack on http://localhost:4566/avaliacao\n- prod: AWS API Gateway on https://x250lwug12.execute-api.us-east-1.amazonaws.com/prod/avaliacao\n\nVariables (baseUrl, localUrl, prodUrl, timestamp, feedbackId) are embedded in the collection.\n\nFluxo: primeiro execute 'Selecionar ambiente local' (ou 'prod'), depois os testes de 'Criar Avaliação'.",
    "schema": "https://schema.getpostman.com/json/collection/v2.1.0/collection.json"
  },
  "event": [
    {
      "listen": "prerequest",
      "script": {
        "type": "text/javascript",
        "exec": [
          "// Auto-set timestamp before each request for unique test data",
          "pm.collectionVariables.set('timestamp', Date.now());"
        ]
      }
    }
  ],
  "item": [
    {
      "name": "local",
      "description": "Ambiente local (LocalStack). Seta baseUrl/notificationUrl/historyUrl para localhost.",
      "item": [
        {
          "name": "Selecionar ambiente local",
          "event": [
            {
              "listen": "test",
              "script": {
                "type": "text/javascript",
                "exec": [
                  "pm.collectionVariables.set('baseUrl', pm.collectionVariables.get('localUrl'));",
                  "pm.collectionVariables.set('feedbackId', '');",
                  "pm.test('ambiente local selecionado', () => pm.expect(pm.response.code).to.equal(200));"
                ]
              }
            }
          ],
          "request": {
            "method": "GET",
            "header": [],
            "url": {
              "raw": "{{localUrl}}/health",
              "host": [
                "{{localUrl}}"
              ],
              "path": [
                "health"
              ]
            },
            "description": "Rode este request primeiro para apontar as variáveis para o ambiente local."
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "Criar Avaliação",
          "item": [
            {
              "name": "✅ 201 — nota 1 (urgência HIGH)",
              "event": [
                {
                  "listen": "test",
                  "script": {
                    "type": "text/javascript",
                    "exec": [
                      "pm.test('Status code is 201', () => pm.expect(pm.response.code).to.equal(201));",
                      "const b = pm.response.json();",
                      "pm.test('tem receiveFeedback', () => pm.expect(b).to.have.property('receiveFeedback'));",
                      "const feedback = b.receiveFeedback;",
                      "pm.test('id é UUID', () => pm.expect(feedback.id).to.match(/^[0-9a-f]{8}-[0-9a-f]{4}-[0-9a-f]{4}-[0-9a-f]{4}-[0-9a-f]{12}$/i));",
                      "pm.test('nota é 1', () => pm.expect(feedback.nota).to.equal(1));",
                      "pm.test('urgencia é HIGH', () => pm.expect(feedback.urgencia).to.equal('HIGH'));",
                      "pm.test('dataCriacao é ISO 8601', () => pm.expect(feedback.dataCriacao).to.match(/^\\d{4}-\\d{2}-\\d{2}T/));",
                      "pm.collectionVariables.set('feedbackId', feedback.id);"
                    ]
                  }
                }
              ],
              "request": {
                "method": "POST",
                "header": [
                  {
                    "key": "Content-Type",
